# 3 locks — sports + chrome + the rest of the site

Owner 2026-09-22: every sport except a named open miss, and the rest of the
site, takes **3 locks**. The agent must see the word **UNLOCK** three
times in the same message before any picks, results, card, chart, chrome,
homepage, blog, props, account, or shared-template edit.

## Required phrase

The same message must contain **UNLOCK** 3 times, name the surface, and name
the miss.

```
# BAD — UNLOCK MLB
# BAD — UNLOCK UNLOCK UNLOCK MLB
# BAD — fix soccer, it is slow
# GOOD — UNLOCK repeated 3 times, then SOCCER and the miss
```

## One surface after a valid 3-unlock

Only that named miss. Then lock again. Do not leave a sport UNLOCKED overnight.

Sports: MLB, NHL, NBA, NFL, NCAAF, NCAAB, NCAAW, WNBA, CFL, soccer, tennis, UFC, golf.

Chrome and the rest of the site: HEADER, FOOTER, HAMBURGER, homepage, blog,
props, performance, account, shared templates.
